   Description

   AS National Media & Tech (NMT) is a subsidiary of Axel Springer SE, a
   leading international media company. We develop and operate digital
   products for Germany’s top news brands, reaching over 50 million users
   each month. At Axel Springer, we stand for free journalism and
   unrestricted access to information, allowing people to make free
   decisions. To protect this, the security of our platforms and users is our
   top priority. Your contributions help us keep them safe.

